              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa Altmiller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good. I used Johnsonville mild Italian sausage instead of beef. I would call this more of a spread than a dip. It is too thick to dip chips into. It's better used as a spread for bread or crackers.",
            "datePublished": "2014-10-07T16:48:12.020Z"
