            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used reduced fat cream cheese, Buddig beef and green onions. After tasting it, I threw in another package of the Buddig beef and some homemade ranch dressing mix. It's a little bland without it. This was a great way for me to use make a great cracker spread for the boys this Sunday. NOTE: I used Kaukauna cheese spread.",
